#!/bin/bash
SIL=0; ARGS=()
for a in "$@"; do if [ "$a" = "--silent" ]; then SIL=1; else ARGS+=("$a"); fi; done
set -- "${ARGS[@]}"
if [ "$1" = bg ]; then
  id=$(python3 -c "import json,sys; print([a['id'] for a in json.load(open(sys.argv[1])) if a['name']==sys.argv[2]][0])" "$HOME/.teyvat/MemoryData/plist.json" "$2")
  M=no; [ -e "$HOME/.teyvat/RuntimeCache/$id/attached-back" ] && M=yes
  echo "args=$* silent=$SIL marker_before_start=$M" >> "$HOME/genshin-calls.log"
  mkdir -p "$HOME/.teyvat/RuntimeCache/$id"; echo "{}" > "$HOME/.teyvat/RuntimeCache/$id/detached"; echo " ok"
fi
